 screening policies increased from 22 to 51\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"AAP monitored state legislation using legal and regulatory tracking software and researched regulatory and hospital guidelines on state websites.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"NewSTEPs surveyed state CCHD newborn screening coordinators to assess data sharing and collaboration between birth defects surveillance programs\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"the responses were reported by the jurisdictions’ CCHD screening contact person and not independently verified.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"outcome_types\"]}", "type": "text"}]}